### ========================================
### 个人信息管理测试
### ========================================

### 登录获取 Token（zhangsan）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 获取个人信息 - 正常情况
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile
Authorization: {{user_token}}

### 获取个人信息 - 未登录（应返回 401）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile

### ========================================
### 修改邮箱功能测试
### ========================================

### 登录获取 Token（zhangsan）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 修改邮箱 - 正常情况
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "email": "zhangsan_new@example.com"
}

### 修改邮箱 - 邮箱已被其他用户使用
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "email": "admin@example.com"
}

### 修改邮箱 - 邮箱格式错误
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "email": "invalid-email"
}

### 修改邮箱 - 邮箱为空
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "email": ""
}

### ========================================
### 修改个人密码功能测试
### ========================================

### 登录获取 Token（newuser）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "abc123"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 修改个人密码 - 正常情况
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "oldPassword": "abc123",
  "newPassword": "NewTest123"
}

### 修改个人密码 - 原密码错误
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "oldPassword": "wrongPassword",
  "newPassword": "NewTest123"
}

### 修改个人密码 - 新密码与原密码相同
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "oldPassword": "NewTest123",
  "newPassword": "NewTest123"
}

### 修改个人密码 - 新密码格式错误
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{user_token}}

{
  "oldPassword": "abc123",
  "newPassword": "abc"
}

### 修改个人密码 - 未登录（应返回 401）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "abc123",
  "newPassword": "NewTest123"
}

### 验证新密码登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "NewTest123"
}